        "cooked": "<p>Quick clarification needed here:</p><p>When Wraith has her Combat Stance in play and uses her Stealth power...</p><p>If someone hits her for two or less points of damage (being reduced to 0 by her Stealth power), does she still get to trigger Combat Stance and deal 2 melee damage to that target?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
