        "raw": "<p>Combat Stance (or anything else that triggers off of damage) will only activate if the hitpoint value actually changed.&nbsp; If an attack can&#39;t get through the damage reduction or is redirected away to another target, damage wasn&#39;t actually dealt to Wraith.</p><p>EDIT: Accursed ninja!</p>",
